
# 🎓 Student Portal

A full-stack Student Management System built using **React, Spring Boot, and MySQL**.

The application allows users to add, view, search, update, and delete student records through a simple and professional web interface.

---

## 🚀 Features

- ➕ Add new student
- 📋 View all students
- 🔍 Search student by ID
- ✏️ Update student details
- 🗑️ Delete student
- 📊 Display total students
- 📚 Display number of courses
- 🏫 Display number of departments
- 📱 User-friendly interface
- 🔗 REST API integration
- 💾 MySQL database integration

